notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T17:18:01.807Z","harness:codex",Implement a stable leaderboard that derives environment-version and contamination refusals from stored typed dependencies.
  "2026-08-20T17:42:15.596Z","harness:codex","Implemented pm rl leaderboard over PmClient.listAllComplete({includeBody:true}); filtering begins only after the SDK certifies the full unbounded corpus. Every EvalResult body, content id, typed metadata, source Run edge, Benchmark edge, Environment identity, reward spec, and run-environment dependency is re-verified. Ranking is direction-aware and byte-stable on equal scores, with every provenance field retained in JSON and table rows."
  "2026-08-20T18:11:59.929Z","harness:codex","Declined one CodeRabbit completeness-guard suggestion after checking the installed 2026.8.20 SDK implementation and types: PmClient.listAllComplete constructs an all-status/full/strict/unbounded request and certifyCompleteListResult throws before returning on any incomplete envelope; complete_list is the resulting certificate object, not a boolean. README completeness wording remains accurate."
